  "slaughter": [{ en: "We learned in history how a past slaughter was remembered with care.", zh: "历史上我们在课堂上了解到那场杀戮被慎重纪念。" }, { en: "The museum shows how communities honored peace after a wartime slaughter.", zh: "博物馆展示了战时杀戮后社区如何纪念和平。" }],
