  "thresh": [{ en: "Farmers thresh the grain after harvest.", zh: "农民收获后打谷。" }, { en: "They threshed the wheat on the floor.", zh: "他们在地上打麦子。" }],
  "threshold": [{ en: "We stood at the threshold of the old library.", zh: "我们站在旧图书馆的门口。" }, { en: "She crossed the threshold into the new grade.", zh: "她跨入了新年级的门槛。" }],
